              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0910.4001"}> arXiv:0910.4001
              )
          %p
            and the general theory of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomology"} cohomology
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+cohomology"} twisted cohomology
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+coefficient+%E2%88%9E-bundles"} local coefficient ∞-bundles
            as referred to in
            %em
